  "changes": [
    "Prepare the unchanged pinned native Full/AMaZE Auto pair away from the GPU submission actor, using existing Render(None) quality keys.",
    "Single active preparation, one completed result including absent, per-waiter cancellation, joined native return, source metadata revalidation and per-editor decode/quality guards.",
    "Serialize native preparation and full Mac export on their shared worker so the expensive develops cannot overlap each other; each reuses the same core fit.",
    "Rebind immutable artifacts on GPU resize; apply the same artifacts directly in the existing fused Rust CPU chain/encode before host quantization, without a sampled CI cube or extra image-sized buffer.",
    "Preserve public legacy CPU APIs and iOS proxy behavior; invalid native artifacts refuse before rendering, and CPU failure releases its permit without publishing a legacy fallback.",
    "Refresh on the current generation; reject stale proxy publication, require the actual frame identity before preview persistence, join/settle on exit and cancel/join on transient-memory release.",
    "Bump Apple rendered-preview/tile versions to9/6; retain full-export arithmetic, original RAWs, XMP schema, model flags and ACR budgets."
  ],
